      <h1>How Public Companies Participate in Bitcoin</h1>
      <p class="msc-learn-page__deck">Public companies can participate in Bitcoin by holding bitcoin, mining it, building payment or infrastructure products, providing custody or market services, issuing financial products, or financing a corporate strategy around the asset. These activities create different risks, disclosures, and incentives. Owning shares in a company is not the same as owning its bitcoin, and no treasury strategy, product, executive, or shareholder receives authority over Bitcoin consensus.</p>
